{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Mysterious Play OVA","A year after the events of Fushigi Yuugi, Tamahome is pulled back into the book and is sent on a complicated ride through illusion, confusion, and betrayal. Meanwhile, Yui is acting oddly and Miaka is heartbroken over the loss of Tamahome, while Keisuke and Tetsuya try to discover what is going on with the book.\n\n\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)"],"ja":["ふしぎ遊戯",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[{"id":123,"relation":"prequel"},{"id":381,"relation":"sequel"}],"id":"mal-380","ids":{"shikimori":380,"mal":380,"anilist":380,"kodik":"serial-73330"},"kodikIds":["serial-25628","serial-73330"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-25628":"2020-05-11T17:42:53Z","serial-73330":"2026-02-11T15:43:07Z"},"title":"Таинственная игра OVA","originalTitle":"Fushigi Yuugi (1996)","alt":"Fushigi Yugi: The Mysterious Play (1996) Mysterious Play OVA ふしぎ遊戯","description":"Прошёл год после событий оригинального сериала « Таинственная игра », и Тамахомэ вдруг снова переносится обратно во «Вселенную четырёх богов» через сложную иллюзию, в которой он полностью сбит с толку. Тем временем Миака переживает исчезновение Тамы , Юи решает вернуться в книгу, а Кэйсукэ и Тэцуя разбираются, что же всё-таки происходит.","year":1996,"type":"OVA","genres":["седзе","Экшен","Приключения","Фэнтези","Романтика","исэкай","боевые искусства"],"rating":7.11,"popularity":3968,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[123,381],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/380/2a9711beb8c1474112787ed10abd5122.jpeg","width":388,"height":600},"backdrop":{"url":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n380-afqCfkUR82x1.jpg","width":1900,"height":600}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2,3],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-674","dubId":"674","label":"Люб. Одноголосый","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","pr